title: The_End
tags:
---

Heart: You remember this place?

Mind: I think I do. It looks like my palace, my home...

Heart: That's right. And there's your crown, my friend. The throne is yours. After everything, we've made it back. 

Heart: Huh, this place ringing any bells for you?

Mind: Yeah, it does. We started here, didn’t we? Since I left the palace, this realm has been falling apart. 

Heart: I guess that means we’re at the end of our journey, huh?

Mind: Looks like it... I cannot believe I am saying this... but I'll miss this. 

Heart: Although, <i> I <i> did most of the work.

Mind: I guess you did. But I was the one who made the decisions. I was the one who made the choices.

Heart: Fair enough... and even if you forget about your crown, your home... me, I'll be there. I'll always be there. We'll make it back together.

Mind: ...I know. Thank you. 
===
